WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:09.780
I have two images.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:21.920
One is a barren landscape. All glaciers have dried out, all seas and waterfalls are gone.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:28.680
It is bone dry. A bit like a moonscape.

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:41.740
The other is the Ice age in Europe. And Arctic has become a green and vigorous place. A tropical climate,

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:49.540
which in itself sounds pretty pleasant, however I don’t wish for either.

